class_name Maps
## Arena definitions. Each map is plain ASCII so anyone can edit or add one:
##   #  solid block            -  platform (jump up through, S to drop; stops bullets)
##   |  ladder                 +  ladder top / ladder through a platform
##   B  spawn-door barrier (players pass, shots don't)
##   ~  hazard (lava/void)      ^  jump pad              S  spawn point
##   L  laser gate emitter (place under a ceiling; fires down on a timer)
##   V  floor vent (erupts on a timer: damage + launch)
##   h  health +25              H  mega health +100      a  armor +50   D  damage amp
##   w  random weapon slot — every match deals all standard weapons across these at random,
##      and each slot re-rolls whenever it respawns
##   N  Redeemer spot — appears once the round is half over
##   2-9 fixed weapon pickup for that weapon slot (see Weapons.LIST)
## Layout convention: spawn rooms at both ends behind B doors, a buffer balcony/porch,
## then the central arena. Weapon slots sit at deliberate spots, but what spawns there is
## random; power-ups stay fixed. Theme colours are hex; `style` picks the background;
## `music` is the arena's looping track (each track is shared by two arenas).

